{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668170/extras/0175c92265764c6efee23513d95edbcb.avif?t=1748345140\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668170/extras/2c63060ccd702adfd642c9c1898d8975.avif?t=1748345140\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Driving a powerful car, you\u2019re challenged to harness its power in a variety of street races.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668170/extras/d24a3c1b033129fee4ded70c00257fda.poster.avif?t=1748345140\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668170/extras/d24a3c1b033129fee4ded70c00257fda.webm?t=1748345140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668170/extras/d24a3c1b033129fee4ded70c00257fda.mp4?t=1748345140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Versus mode, you take on the AI one-on-one, or the best players through a ghosting mechanism.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668170/extras/6f97a8ea32c26169b31641f0e2ceffeb.avif?t=1748345140\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>In Coast to Coast, join 6 races, from city streets to country roads, competing against tough rivals and challenging your friends to determine the ultimate racer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668170/extras/8c2776c89e51c6aee6e662d80b743583.poster.avif?t=1748345140\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.